@startuml SSD US 2.2.1 - Create Vessel Type
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
	ActorBorderColor #000000
	ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantBorderColor #000000
	ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	LifeLineBorderColor #000000
	LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
}

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Officer
Officer -> System : 1: request to create a new Vessel Type
activate System
System --> Officer : 1.1: request required data\n(name, description, capacity,\nconstraints: max rows, bays, tiers)
deactivate System

Officer -> System : 2: provide Vessel Type data
activate System
System --> Officer : 2.1: validate and create Vessel Type\nconfirmation shown; available for vessel registration\nand searchable by name/description
deactivate System

deactivate Officer
@enduml
